          "q": "Fill in the blanks: (i) The plane through (1, 4, 6) normal to i − 2j + k is ______. (ii) The sum of the intercepts of 2x + 3y + 4z = 24 is ______. (iii) The plane through points with position vectors a, b, c is ______. (iv) The distance of (−1, 2, −3) from 2x − y + 2z = 13 is ______.",
          "answer": "(i) r·(i − 2j + k) = (i + 4j + 6k)·(i − 2j + k) = 1 − 8 + 6 = −1.\n(ii) Intercepts 12, 8, 6 ⇒ sum 26.\n(iii) (r − a)·[(b − a) × (c − a)] = 0.\n(iv) |−2 − 2 − 6 − 13|/3 = 23/3.",
